  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 702.04 Cut-Off Date for Non-Certified Applicant. Pursuant to RSA 381:4, after August 21, 1979, no person shall be eligible for appointment as a railroad police officer unless such person is a certified police officer in accordance with RSA 188-F or the law of another state.\n\nSource. #2281, eff 1-16-83; ss by #2790, eff 8-2-84; ss by #5067, eff 2-21-91; ss by #6456, INTERIM, eff 2-21-97, EXPIRED: 6-21-97; ss by #6473, eff 3-25-97, EXPIRED: 3-25-05\n\nNew. #8776, eff 12-23-06; ss by #10889, eff 7-16-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c700.html"
